      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The entire repoorting system generally needs an overhaul as it is currently lacking more fitting options for users and avatars, kind of feels like VRChat developers doesn't want to believe themselves that their security measures can be bypassed. An option for user reporting that's definitely is missing \"Modified client\" and an option for avatar reporting that's missing there is \"crasher\" and \"safety bypass\" (for example, spawn animation sounds bypassing all of the safety options configured).",
